      <activity id="1ff90150-adb2-5f24-8c01-f9dc4e8fdbe2" activityNameId="a395aaad-03c5-5c78-b08e-9c4e3d211e1e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium dichromate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium dichromate, at plant
Sodium dichromate, produced by the sulfuric acid process. The electrolysis production process is not included here, therefore the data quality is considered poor.;
CAS number: 010588-01-9; 
Formula: Na2Cr2O7; 
UUID: ac0d1254-9ed4-38b0-bb54-6fc5129415f0
Included are the raw material, as well as the energy and auxillaries input are taken into account togehter with air emissions and waste. Transports and infrastructure are estimated. No water emissions are taken into account.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: based on literature data on the acidification process, taken from plant data in Europe and North America
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: see technology 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ac0d1254-9ed4-38b0-bb54-6fc5129415f0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
